        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In this universe, a down-on-their-luck couple find themselves in impossible debt.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isaac</strong> specializes in all things <strong>offense</strong>, using weapons from <strong>assault rifles, shotguns, snipers, to riot gear and tasers.</strong> Furthermore, his <strong> grenades </strong>provide <strong>ample crowd control</strong>, and can be used once enough damage has been dealt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sona, </strong>on the other hand, focuses on all things <strong>defense</strong>, using her <strong>healing magic</strong>  to keep the two standing strong.  She can also <strong>revive a fallen party member,</strong> or<strong> grant them temporary invulnerability.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/27c1d6a584860c0a5f2487ade3d5ae9a.poster.avif?t=1789268004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/27c1d6a584860c0a5f2487ade3d5ae9a.webm?t=1789268004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/27c1d6a584860c0a5f2487ade3d5ae9a.mp4?t=1789268004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>These two will be your party to command. </strong>Take on missions, explore the site, defeat enemies in your way, and complete the objective. <strong>Allocate resources and turns tactically</strong> and <strong>utilize each party member's movesets</strong> to keep your team alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/84ba933816c5528ff1abe63a9472bde5.poster.avif?t=1789268004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/84ba933816c5528ff1abe63a9472bde5.webm?t=1789268004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/84ba933816c5528ff1abe63a9472bde5.mp4?t=1789268004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/b70902c2fdd64b1f248cd3151c39c983.poster.avif?t=1789268004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/b70902c2fdd64b1f248cd3151c39c983.webm?t=1789268004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094440/extras/b70902c2fdd64b1f248cd3151c39c983.mp4?t=1789268004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Should you succeed, your party will gain credits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With credits, purchase various equipment and equipment upgrades that the game has to offer. <strong>Each freelancer can be armed with</strong> <strong>their own set of upgrades</strong>, introducing more mechanics to use in combat. When ready, <strong>take on more dangerous, but also more lucrative missions, </strong>and eventually pay off the looming debt that lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The game is currently a polished 2-5 hour turn based RPG experience with new content releases planned.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unique Enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Unique Bosses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional Mechanics + Upgrades (Armor, Stims, Deadeye, Debuff Arrows, etc)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Chapters</p>",
